<title>USA: Atec Group Q1 net falls after acquisition.</title>
<headline>Atec Group Q1 net falls after acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>NORTHPORT, N.Y. 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>ATEC Group, Inc.</p>
<p>				     Financial Highlights (Unaudited)</p>
<p>					     For the Three Months Ended</p>
<p>						   9/30/96	  9/30/95</p>
<p> Net revenues			   $25,639,086 $14,279,684 (a)</p>
<p> Net income				    400,603    160,891 (a)</p>
<p> Net Income Per Share			    .02		.01</p>
<p>Common and Common</p>
<p> equivalent shares (fully diluted)  25,541,373     15,611,500</p>
<p>(a) Innovative Business Micros, Inc., which ATEC acquired in June 1996, changed its fiscal year end from Sept 30 to June 30.  If Innovative results were included in the first quarter of the fiscal 1996 year, revenues would have been $18,841,816 with net income of $207,262 or one cent per share. Shares outstanding include the shares issued for the acquisition.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
